{"id":"387103572d3822c3","group":"91","path":"91/91-cor-conservative-theory-cannot-prove-liar.md","title":"一致的捕获—释放理论不能判定说谎者","display":"cor-conservative-theory-cannot-prove-liar — 一致的捕获—释放理论不能判定说谎者","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-cor-conservative-theory-cannot-prove-liar","aliases":["91-cor-conservative-theory-cannot-prove-liar","91-cor-conserv-liar"],"display":"cor-conservative-theory-cannot-prove-liar — 一致的捕获—释放理论不能判定说谎者","depends_on":["[[91-df-liar-sentence]]","[[91-df-capture-axiom]]","[[91-df-release-axiom]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-cor-conservative-theory-cannot-prove-liar"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-cor-conservative-theory-cannot-prove-liar</span><span>91-cor-conserv-liar</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-conservative-theory-cannot-prove-liar — 一致的捕获—释放理论不能判定说谎者"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cac035693aea2791\" href=\"?note=cac035693aea2791\" title=\"91-df-liar-sentence\">91-df-liar-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7dc6a6fb8ddfca30\" href=\"?note=7dc6a6fb8ddfca30\" title=\"91-df-capture-axiom\">91-df-capture-axiom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"efd61e76586d57ab\" href=\"?note=efd61e76586d57ab\" title=\"91-df-release-axiom\">91-df-release-axiom</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{T}_T\">\\(\\mathcal{T}_T\\)</span> (经典背景逻辑中的一致真理理论)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span> (说谎者句子, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"cac035693aea2791\" href=\"?note=cac035693aea2791\" title=\"91-df-liar-sentence\">91-df-liar-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathcal T_T)\">\\(\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathcal T_T)\\)</span> (句法一致性)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Cap}_{\\lambda}(\\mathcal T_T)\">\\(\\operatorname{Cap}_{\\lambda}(\\mathcal T_T)\\)</span>\n(<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_T\\vdash\\lambda\">\\(\\mathcal T_T\\vdash\\lambda\\)</span> 蕴含\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_T\\vdash T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})\">\\(\\mathcal T_T\\vdash T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Rel}_{\\lambda}(\\mathcal T_T)\">\\(\\operatorname{Rel}_{\\lambda}(\\mathcal T_T)\\)</span>\n(<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_T\\vdash T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})\">\\(\\mathcal T_T\\vdash T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})\\)</span> 蕴含\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_T\\vdash\\lambda\">\\(\\mathcal T_T\\vdash\\lambda\\)</span>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}conservative\\text{-}theory\\text{-}cannot\\text{-}prove\\text{-}liar}\n\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\begin{array}{c}\n\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathcal T_T)\\land\n\\mathcal T_T\\vdash\n\\bigl(\\lambda\\leftrightarrow\n\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})\\bigr)\\\\\n\\land\\ \\operatorname{Cap}_{\\lambda}(\\mathcal T_T)\n\\land\\operatorname{Rel}_{\\lambda}(\\mathcal T_T)\n\\end{array}\n\\right]\n\\to\n\\bigl(\\mathcal T_T\\nvdash\\lambda\\land\\mathcal T_T\\nvdash\\neg\\lambda\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}conservative\\text{-}theory\\text{-}cannot\\text{-}prove\\text{-}liar}\n\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\begin{array}{c}\n\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathcal T_T)\\land\n\\mathcal T_T\\vdash\n\\bigl(\\lambda\\leftrightarrow\n\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})\\bigr)\\\\\n\\land\\ \\operatorname{Cap}_{\\lambda}(\\mathcal T_T)\n\\land\\operatorname{Rel}_{\\lambda}(\\mathcal T_T)\n\\end{array}\n\\right]\n\\to\n\\bigl(\\mathcal T_T\\nvdash\\lambda\\land\\mathcal T_T\\nvdash\\neg\\lambda\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{T}_T \\nvdash\\lambda\">\\(\\mathcal{T}_T \\nvdash\\lambda\\)</span> : 不能证明说谎者</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{T}_T \\nvdash\\neg\\lambda\">\\(\\mathcal{T}_T \\nvdash\\neg\\lambda\\)</span> : 不能证明说谎者的否定</li>\n</ul>\n<p>推论意义：\n结论来自一致性、说谎者对角式与 capture/release，不来自算术保守性。\n保守性只约束基础语言后果，单独对含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的说谎者没有这种推论。</p>\n<p>若证明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span>，capture 给出\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})\">\\(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})\\)</span>，\n而对角式给出其否定；若证明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\lambda\">\\(\\neg\\lambda\\)</span>，对角式在经典逻辑中给出\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})\">\\(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})\\)</span>，release 又给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span>。两种情况都\n违背一致性。</p>\n<p>引用的基础 capture/release 原子只把规则定义在\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_0\">\\(\\mathcal L_0\\)</span> 句子上，不能直接用于含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span>；所以本推论\n把规则对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span> 的可采纳性明确列作额外前提。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-liar-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"cac035693aea2791","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-liar-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-capture-axiom","status":"resolved","id":"7dc6a6fb8ddfca30","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-capture-axiom]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-release-axiom","status":"resolved","id":"efd61e76586d57ab","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-release-axiom]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-liar-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"cac035693aea2791","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\lambda$ (说谎者句子, see [[91-df-liar-sentence]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal{T}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathcal T_T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Cap}_{\\lambda}(\\mathcal T_T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T_T\\vdash\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T_T\\vdash T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Rel}_{\\lambda}(\\mathcal T_T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T_T\\vdash T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T_T\\vdash\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}conservative\\text{-}theory\\text{-}cannot\\text{-}prove\\text{-}liar}\n\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\begin{array}{c}\n\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathcal T_T)\\land\n\\mathcal T_T\\vdash\n\\bigl(\\lambda\\leftrightarrow\n\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})\\bigr)\\\\\n\\land\\ \\operatorname{Cap}_{\\lambda}(\\mathcal T_T)\n\\land\\operatorname{Rel}_{\\lambda}(\\mathcal T_T)\n\\end{array}\n\\right]\n\\to\n\\bigl(\\mathcal T_T\\nvdash\\lambda\\land\\mathcal T_T\\nvdash\\neg\\lambda\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal{T}_T \\nvdash\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{T}_T \\nvdash\\neg\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_0","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false}],"bytes":2339,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["cac035693aea2791","7dc6a6fb8ddfca30","efd61e76586d57ab"]}